# Every hook is a shebang script executed directly - a CRLF-mangled shebang
# or an embedded \r mid-line breaks execution outright on Windows, where
# GitHub's hosted runner defaults core.autocrlf to true on checkout (issue
# #67). Force LF regardless of that setting or a contributor's local config.
*.sh text eol=lf
# SKILL.md files are byte-budgeted and frontmatter-parsed by tests/skill-lint.sh
# (issue #195); a CRLF checkout would change both, so keep them LF everywhere.
skills/**/SKILL.md text eol=lf
